# Carousel Studio — rendered output (frames/MP4s) is disposable, regenerated per job, stays
# local. assets/ (avatar cutouts) is the OPPOSITE: those are curated, approved, load-bearing
# source assets the render worker's Docker image must actually ship with — tracked normally,
# same as vendor/fonts/. Source (gen.js, render.sh, slide templates, base.css) also tracked.
carousel-studio/output/*
!carousel-studio/output/.gitkeep

